  "details": "A system where you could create tags, and assign them to users(ie: if a user is someone you play games with you could make a tag called game and add said tag to them, or create a tag for a friend group [like \"Sam and Friends\" or \"Movie Knights folks\"] and add it to them) and allow filtering using the tags (so if i want to watch a movie maybe i search all the users I've assigned the \"movie\" tag to, and then pick from there who to join or invite, or if I'm in a gaming mood i check what users I've set the \"game\" tag to are online)",
